{
  "schema": 5,
  "notes": [
    "Crossbows are a ranged subsystem independent from forged weapon parts.",
    "The material matrix is derived from Heavy Crossbows registered by the installed Spartan Weaponry 3.2.1, Spartan Undergarden 1.1.0, Spartan Twilight 3.1.1, Spartan Fire 2.1.0 and Spartan Cataclysm 1.1.2 set.",
    "Normal material upgrades use the wooden version of the same family plus two units of the material.",
    "Materials whose native identity cannot be expressed unambiguously with one repeated ingredient use a base_material + catalyst recipe override; this is currently limited to elemental Dragon Bone and Myrmex Stinger variants.",
    "Heavy Crossbow IDs remain native; Pistol Crossbow and Arbalest use Awakening IDs.",
    "All three families use arrows. Bolt progression is obsolete.",
    "Family stats are derived from the audited Spartan Heavy Crossbow baseline; material durability/enchantability comes from the material tiers used by the installed addons.",
    "unbreakable materials intentionally omit max durability on Awakening Pistol Crossbow and Arbalest.",
    "special_traits records audited native trait registry IDs; addon behavior is only activated when its RangedJS mapping has been verified.",
    "For materials already represented by Awakening bows, the established Awakening tint palette is reused for visual consistency; the bow manifest is not used to determine the crossbow material matrix."
  ],
